From ae1c436aaecb8b20a68877615b59c508a1d341f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 03:00:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: mediatek: mt6878: add the modem PCM interface and a
 hostless speech front end

PCM 1 connects the AFE to the internal modem for voice calls: the
microphone (ADDA UL) feeds PCM_1_PB, and PCM_1_CAP feeds the codec DAC
(ADDA DL) and I2SOUT4. The hostless speech front end moves no data;
keeping it open powers those paths for the duration of a call.

Based on the MediaTek mt6878-dai-pcm.c and mt6878-dai-hostless.c.
---
